{{!
    @template mod_oksigeniajepyso/routine_preview

    In the form of the activity, under the code of the routine: what that code is, its exercises with their stills, so
    that nobody has to guess. When the code changes in the form, the script of the form hides it and says that the new
    routine will show once saved.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * size - How many exercises and how long
    * exercises - Each with name, poster, hasposter, mirrored, dosage, side and band
    * facts - Each with factlabel and factfigure
    * limit - The acceptable discomfort, in words

    Example context (json):
    {
        "size": "3 ejercicios · unos 9 minutos",
        "exercises": [
            {
                "name": "Levantarse de la silla",
                "poster": "https://example.com/mod/oksigeniajepyso/reproductor/modelos/posters/silla.webp",
                "hasposter": true,
                "mirrored": false,
                "dosage": "2 series de 8 · ida 2 s, mantén 1 s, vuelta 2 s",
                "side": "",
                "band": ""
            }
        ],
        "facts": [
            {"factlabel": "Descanso entre series", "factfigure": "45 s"}
        ],
        "limit": "Molestia aceptable: hasta 5 de 10"
    }
}}
<div class="mod-oksigeniajepyso-preview" id="mod_oksigeniajepyso_preview">
    <p class="mod-oksigeniajepyso-label">{{#str}}routinepreview, mod_oksigeniajepyso{{/str}} <span class="mod-oksigeniajepyso-figure">· {{size}}</span></p>
    <ol class="mod-oksigeniajepyso-minilist">
        {{#exercises}}
        <li>
            <span class="mod-oksigeniajepyso-still is-mini">{{#hasposter}}<img class="{{#mirrored}}mod-oksigeniajepyso-mirrored{{/mirrored}}" src="{{poster}}" alt="" width="192" height="144" loading="lazy">{{/hasposter}}</span>
            <span class="mod-oksigeniajepyso-mini-body">
                <span class="mod-oksigeniajepyso-mini-name">{{name}}</span>
                <span class="mod-oksigeniajepyso-quiet">{{dosage}}{{#side}} · {{side}}{{/side}}{{#band}} · {{band}}{{/band}}</span>
            </span>
        </li>
        {{/exercises}}
    </ol>
    <p class="mod-oksigeniajepyso-quiet">{{#facts}}{{factlabel}}: {{factfigure}} · {{/facts}}{{limit}}</p>
</div>
<p class="mod-oksigeniajepyso-stale" id="mod_oksigeniajepyso_stale" hidden>{{#str}}routinepreviewstale, mod_oksigeniajepyso{{/str}}</p>
